  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.5\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Updated Correspondence models by @danielskovli in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1820\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Fix signing notification for signees with multiple identifiers by @danielskovli in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1812\n* Poll app secret config files by @martinothamar-agent in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1811\n* Ensure to mask SSN numbers by @framitdavid in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1822\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* Update actions/add-to-project digest to 828acb6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1794\n## New Contributors\n* @framitdavid made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1822\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.12.4...v8.12.5",
